        "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "Interpretation is where meaning—and error—come from; data is just data until interpreted; recognizing interpretation as a step lets you question it and consider alternatives",
